WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.096
Episode four: sections, widgets and buttons.

2
00:00:03.447 --> 00:00:04.629
Fields are classes.

3
00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:09.733
Blocks of the page, like the header, a card or the unit tabs, are plain functions.

4
00:00:09.733 --> 00:00:12.969
Each one returns an element to put on the page, and,

5
00:00:12.969 --> 00:00:16.018
if it shows live information, a refresh function.

6
00:00:16.018 --> 00:00:18.321
That small object is called a widget.

7
00:00:18.672 --> 00:00:20.435
The accordion is a good example.

8
00:00:20.435 --> 00:00:23.739
Its refresh function updates the three out of seven counter.

9
00:00:23.739 --> 00:00:27.870
It still remembers its elements long after the outer function has returned.

10
00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:29.247
That is called a closure.

11
00:00:29.599 --> 00:00:32.815
Buttons work the same way, with a third registry.

12
00:00:32.815 --> 00:00:36.031
The button’s type in the JSON picks its function:

13
00:00:36.031 --> 00:00:39.313
save, email, print, timer, workflow, or data pull.

14
00:00:39.313 --> 00:00:42.595
Any other type is handed to the website to handle.

15
00:00:42.946 --> 00:00:44.445
Here is Submit for review.

16
00:00:44.445 --> 00:00:49.923
The status changes to review, and the website’s onWorkflow callback sends the report with form.

17
00:00:49.923 --> 00:00:50.442
submit().

18
00:00:50.793 --> 00:00:54.109
If the CRM refuses the report, the status is put back,

19
00:00:54.109 --> 00:00:58.285
so the screen never says review for a report the CRM never received.

20
00:00:58.285 --> 00:01:03.259
And the button is disabled while it sends, so a double click can’t send it twice.

21
00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:05.024
Let’s try the reviewer.

22
00:01:05.024 --> 00:01:06.254
Reject needs a note.

23
00:01:06.254 --> 00:01:10.313
Without one, the note box is outlined in red, and nothing is sent.

24
00:01:10.666 --> 00:01:12.769
With a note, the report is rejected,

25
00:01:12.769 --> 00:01:16.450
the status at the top changes, and the banner shows the reason.

26
00:01:19.392 --> 00:01:23.046
In the last episode: how the form keeps working without a network.
